OL,3,GNEWSAKent trees avoid heatwave growth
OL,4,Aissues
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent Christmas tree farmer says his
OL,7,Fcrop has bucked the regional trend of
OL,8,Fpoor growth due to the hot summer.
OL,10,FGrowers across south-east England have
OL,11,Freported stunted pine tree growth, and
OL,12,Fsaplings withering away during the hot
OL,13,Fsummer in which some places did not see
OL,14,Frainfall for 40 days.
OL,16,FHowever Rob Schroeder from Kingswood
OL,17,FChristmas Trees near Maidstone said the
OL,18,Fheatwaves did not particularly affect
OL,19,Fhis stock as it was already well
OL,20,Festablished.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
