OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAKent trees avoid heatwave growth
OL,4,Aissues
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think it will be a very good season
OL,7,Fdespite the dry weather. The Nordmann
OL,8,Ffir are very deep-rooted to reach the
OL,9,Fmoisture in the soil and they look
OL,10,Fremarkably well, although cost of
OL,11,Fliving issues are making it harder to
OL,12,Fgrow them."
